# SPA fallback is handled by wrangler.toml's `not_found_handling =
# "single-page-application"` under [assets] — that's the native mechanism for
# Cloudflare Workers static assets. A catch-all rule here (`/*  /index.html  200`)
# is redundant with it and Wrangler flags it as an infinite redirect loop, so it
# has been removed. Keep this file for any future explicit, non-SPA redirects.
